     Row (48 mentions in ExerciseCatalog) - so the old TWO-TOWER CABLE CROSSOVER drew a machine
     the filter does not offer. This is the station those exercises are done on: one tower, a
     pulley at the top, a slack cable down to a D-handle. It also separates the icon from
     ic_eq_machine, which gained a seat in the same pass. -->
